      "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "💀  ServiceBus  Dead-letter  (same queue,  DLQ sub-queue)\nmessageActions.DeadLetterMessageAsync(...)\n\nreasons:   DeserializationFailed  ·  EmptyDataset  ·  UnsupportedEncoding\n                ValidationFailed  (fail_count + top-10 failures)  ·  UnknownSchema  ·  ProcessingFailed\n\nunhandled exception  →  re-thrown  →  ServiceBus retry policy",
